321	        // comment text is removed by a browser before tokenization, so a url(...)-shaped fragment inside a comment
322	        // is never fetched and must not by itself reject (or check) its declaration; the declaration keeps its text
323	        assertEquals("<div style=\"/* url(javascript:x) */background:red\">x</div>",
